/// Witnesses one conversational turn.
///
/// `turn.occurred_at` is already stamped by the caller through
/// [`stamp_occurred_at`], because the engine DTO's field is required and a
/// backend cannot tell an omitted `0` from a deliberate one.

/// Recalls a memory pack.
///
/// The lease the engine takes is not a client input, and a bearer slip
/// is not one. Embedded, `Effort::High`, `XHigh` and `Max` return the
/// engine's `LEASE_REQUIRED`: this client mints no lease. Remote, the
/// server admits them on a line of its own and reranks on its `[models]`
/// reranker, or runs them unreranked and says so when it has none.
/// `media` is embedded by the server into its declared space; embedded,
/// it returns `MODEL_UNAVAILABLE`. `query_affect` (valence in -1..=1,
/// arousal and dominance in 0..=1) ranks by emotion congruence, embedded
/// and remote alike; out of range it returns `BAD_REQUEST`.
/// Explicit `scope.world_ref` recalls of retained foreign worlds carry
/// `MemoryItem::stale`: stale-since and age in seconds (when known), the
/// terminal reason and pact epoch. This selection grants no read authority.
/// `token_budget` (0: uncut) sizes the rendered `format`; omitted, the
/// window budget of `reader_agent_ref`'s memory profile, else 4,000.

/// Lists governance receipts, newest first, a page at a time: the gate
/// decision ledger, or the receipts of the named kinds. `after` takes the
/// page before's `next_after`.
